      "description": "SignalFlow turns manual thoughts and authorized work evidence into reviewable content opportunities, narrative plans, and exact destination revisions. Golden Path 1 is accepted for the owner workflow; GitHub-connected Golden Path 2 remains an active end-to-end acceptance gate.",
